          "createdAt": "2025-11-24T18:42:38Z",
          "updatedAt": "2025-11-24T18:42:38Z",
          "comments": [
            {
              "originalPosition": 150,
              "body": "At the risk of bloating the response with such objects, would it not be better to align it with the RPSL and have instead just an array of CIDR strings here? Since one could later easily use these \"natural\" CIDR identifiers to look up IP network objects.",
              "createdAt": "2025-11-24T18:42:38Z",
              "updatedAt": "2025-11-24T19:24:52Z"
            }
          ]
        },
