          "comments": [
            {
              "originalPosition": 164,
              "body": "This is a more general comment: Should we have a member for the raw RPSL in each of the new IRR object classes? That could help in case the current data structure does not suffice in capturing all the RPSL for this object. It should also help from the WYSIWYG and \"what's actually in the field\" angles, I think. :)",
              "createdAt": "2025-11-24T18:49:10Z",
              "updatedAt": "2025-11-24T18:49:33Z"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "PRR_kwDOQa7tLM7QuPmc",
