          "comments": [
            {
              "originalPosition": 356,
              "body": "Knowing some RIRs do not support the peering-set and filter-set RPSL functionality, wonder if these RPSL classes should be optional for this new extension? In other words, what RPSL classes are required to be implemented in RDAP, versus not.\r\n\r\nThe expired draft had a similar discussion point: https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/draft-newton-weirds-route-policy-00#auto-8\r\n",
              "createdAt": "2025-11-24T18:56:16Z",
              "updatedAt": "2025-11-24T19:26:23Z"
            }
          ]
        },
